{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108522","id":3223310438,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ehKrP","number":108522,"title":"Fix GI and SSR artifacts with camera frustum offset","user":{"login":"SwordofMorning","id":61505018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTA1MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61505018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning","html_url":"https://github.com/SwordofMorning","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwordofMorning/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-07-11T15:27:06Z","updated_at":"2025-07-12T10:31:45Z","closed_at":"2025-07-11T19:49:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108522","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108522","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108522.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108522.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Description\r\nThis PR fixes rendering artifacts in VoxelGI, SDFGI, and Screen Space Reflections when using Camera3D with frustum offset.\r\n\r\nFixes #108508 \r\n\r\n## Problem\r\nWhen `frustum_offset` is set to non-zero values in Camera3D, global illumination and screen-space effects render with incorrect positioning, causing visual artifacts where lighting and reflections appear displaced from their actual locations.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\nThe rendering effects perform screen-space to world-space coordinate transformations using projection information, but were not accounting for the frustum offset in their calculations.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n- Added `offset` member to `Projection` struct to store frustum offset\r\n- Implemented `get_offset()` method to retrieve the stored offset\r\n- Updated projection info calculations in affected rendering effects to compensate for the offset\r\n- Temporarily disabled size assertion for Projection struct in extension API\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Verified fix using the reproduction project from issue #108508\r\n- Confirmed VoxelGI, SDFGI, and SSR effects now render correctly with frustum offset\r\n- No regressions observed in normal projection scenarios\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nThe extension API size check is temporarily disabled as this is a targeted fix. A future PR could address this more comprehensively if needed.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108522/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}